title: "Pareto Support Proofs: exact certificates and standalone verification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Clim
    given-names: Antonio
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4745-0431"
    affiliation: "Bucharest University of Economic Studies"
version: 0.6.2
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  An exact generator, a standalone checker, machine-readable schemas and
  retained computational evidence for proof objects of non-negative
  weighted-sum supportability and unsupportedness in finite multi-objective
  optimisation.
keywords:
  - multi-objective optimisation
  - weighted-sum supportability
  - unsupportedness
  - proof certificates
  - exact verification
  - reproducibility
